# NOTICE — lineage

GSM2Computer is derived from Android GSM↔VoIP gateway code with this ancestry:

1. **Original project:** [pulpoff/gsm2sip](https://github.com/pulpoff/gsm2sip) — “Android based GSM-SIP gateway” (Magisk priv-app, SIP bridge, `gsm2sip` screenshots).
2. **Intermediate fork:** [rmeehub/gsm-sip-gateway](https://github.com/rmeehub/gsm-sip-gateway) — same codebase, repo renamed; its GitHub description states it is a fork of `pulpoff/gsm2sip`.
3. **Development fork:** [sourman/gsm-sip-gateway](https://github.com/sourman/gsm-sip-gateway) — GitHub fork of rmeehub; Pixel 7 audio work, OpenAI Realtime WebSocket transport, SignalWire test rig, etc.

This repo (`gsm2computer`) takes the WebSocket stream path from that line of work, removes SIP/SignalWire/Twilio, and retargets the product at streaming GSM calls to a hub computer.

